<ul>
    <li>Carbons adjacent to the ether appear in the region of 50-80 ppm.</li>
    <li>Carbons that are part of the epoxide appear in the region of 40-60 ppm.</li>
    <li>Carbons adjacent to the sulfur in sulfides and thiols appear in the region of 20-40 ppm.</li>
</ul>



